meta {
  name: List jobs
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/jobs?workplaceType=HYBRID&workplaceType=REMOTE&employmentType=FULL_TIME&skill=typescript&postedWithinDays=30&page=1&limit=20
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:query {
  workplaceType: HYBRID
  workplaceType: REMOTE
  employmentType: FULL_TIME
  skill: typescript
  postedWithinDays: 30
  page: 1
  limit: 20
  ~locationId: {{locationId}}
  ~sort: newest
}

docs {
  Active jobs, sorted by posted date (published date, or first-seen date when there is none), newest first by default. Every filter is optional; repeat a param for several values (OR-ed).

  - `workplaceType`: REMOTE, HYBRID, ONSITE
  - `employmentType`: FULL_TIME, PART_TIME, CONTRACT, INTERNSHIP, FREELANCE
  - `locationId`: location UUIDs (run **List locations**)
  - `skill`: skill slugs (run **List skills**)
  - `postedWithinDays`: 1-365
  - `sort`: newest (default) or oldest
  - `page`: starts at 1, default 1
  - `limit`: jobs per page, 1-100, default 20

  - 200: OK - `{ items, total, page, limit, totalPages }`; a page past the end returns empty `items`
  - 400: invalid filter, sort, page or limit, 401: run Login
}